# Token lock

Read DESIGN.md before changing UI. If the file is missing and this is new visual work, stop and run the design-md greenfield skill. Do not invent spacing, type, color, or radius. Prefer existing components and semantic tokens. No raw 13/15/17/18/22px. No raw hex in components.

Name the control before drawing. Every interactive control needs default, focus-visible, active, and disabled. Inputs also need error. Include empty and loading where the surface can enter those states.

After the first screen, audit against DESIGN.md and fix the top three violations.
